isible in the background under a bright blue sky.\" width=\"1920\" height=\"350\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Alfursan/partners/hotel-partners/01092024-alfursan-Jumeirah-top.ashx?h=350&amp;iar=0&amp;w=1920&amp;rev=b34e69fd670e45d3b28c326cda5ab899&amp;hash=61AEE3E55E526AEF4933A9AC6AE21146\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"image-gradient\" id=\"d82af6fe-40cc-4d42-9d6f-dacfff1cd746\"></div></div><!----><!----><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"swiper-slide__content\"><!----><!----><h1 appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Jumeirah</span><!----></h1><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div class=\"custom-pagination ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"container\"><div id=\"cpage_banner\" class=\"custom-pages\"></div></div></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></app-jss-image-link-list><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-space class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"cms-spacer-component\"></div></app-jss-space><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-title-text class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"title-text isCashMilesInView ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><!----><p appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"titleTextSub ng-star-inserted\">\n\n<div class=\"field-section0\">\n\n  <h2>Jumeirah</h2>\n\n  <p>\n    Through our partnership with AlFursan, you can enjoy exclusive benefits and earn Miles at Jumeirah’s exceptional collection of luxury hotels and resorts. From beachfront retreats to vibrant city stays and private residences, Jumeirah welcomes you across the Middle East, Europe, and Asia.\n  </p>\n\n  <p>\n    Known for its warm hospitality and iconic properties, Jumeirah’s portfolio includes:\n  </p>\n\n  <ul class=\"saudia-list saudia-list--unordered\">\n    <li>Jumeirah Burj Al Arab in Dubai</li>\n    <li>Madinat Jumeirah in Dubai</li>\n    <li>Jumeirah Olhahali Island in the Maldives</li>\n    <li>Jumeirah Bali – all-villa luxury resort</li>\n    <li>Jumeirah Capri Palace in Italy</li>\n    <li>Jumeirah Carlton Tower in London</li>\n    <li>Jumeirah Nanjing in China</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h3 class=\"saudia-h3-spacing\">How to earn Miles</h3>\n\n  <ul class=\"saudia-list saudia-list--unordered\">\n    <li>Earn 1 AlFursan Mile for every 1 USD spent on eligible stays.</li>\n    <li>Earn 1 AlFursan Mile when you transfer 2 points from Jumeirah One.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <p>\n    For missing Miles inquiries, please contact Jumeirah directly through \n    <a href=\"https://www.jumeirah.com/en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n      Jumeirah.com\n    </a>.\n  </p>\n\n  <h3 class=\"saudia-h3-spacing\">Terms and conditions</h3>\n\n  <ul class=\"saudia-list saudia-list--unordered\">\n    <li>To earn AlFursan Reward Miles, members must present a valid AlFursan membership card at hotel check-in.</li>\n    <li>AlFursan Reward Miles will be credited within 28 days after completing the eligible hotel stay.</li>\n    <li>Miles are awarded for eligible stays only.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n</div></p><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><!----></sc-placeholder>"}